ptance Criteria\n\n- The initialization-dependency question is answered with a definitive verdict and supporting evidence (plugin source references and/or a reproducible check).\n- If coupled: a concrete refactoring plan is documented (modules, independent initialization path, compatibility constraints). If not coupled: verification evidence demonstrates workspace resolution functioning without initialized tracking stores.\n- A recommendation is delivered stating whether plugin changes are required before the server-side artifacts-only integration can proceed, and of what scope.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\nEnables HLR-7 (P1: auth plugin workspace resolution functions correctly in the artifacts-only context without tracking store initialization), and transitively the P0 workspace-aware artifact serving requirements that build on the plugin's resolution capability.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":67376,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-85f574c21f19b836","agent_id":"a294f4e0cbc229ff0","session_id":"93c9eca1-ec44-4ff5-8343-c9e3bc7bdf0f","uuid":"305cfd83-bdac-4a80-bddc-775712cb90f3","timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:35:30.410Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8009"}
